    "",
    "Committed rather than left on dev on purpose: the dev cluster gets",
    "swept, and a verification that depends on state we do not control is",
    "a claim, not a proof. scripts/check_templates.py rule 13 binds these",
    "to families.json, so changing a pre-fill fails the check until the",
    "run is redone and this file refreshed.",
    "",
    "Curated, not a raw dump: this is a public repo, so it carries the",
